WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.502 --> 00:00:16.484
children stood outside the door and looked around.

2
00:00:16.504 --> 00:00:20.246
"Which house did Haruki put us in?"

3
00:00:20.726 --> 00:00:21.367
asked Vinnie.

4
00:00:21.387 --> 00:00:26.189
"The doors all look the same," said Mandy.

5
00:00:27.890 --> 00:00:31.152
The children walked around trying to find their way back.

6
00:00:32.892 --> 00:00:33.933
But they were lost.

7
00:00:36.234 --> 00:00:39.576
Soon the smell of cooking led the children to a kitchen.

8
00:00:42.317 --> 00:00:44.519
Servants were busily preparing a meal.

9
00:00:45.279 --> 00:00:46.460
One woman saw them.

10
00:00:48.201 --> 00:00:52.263
She was standing over a large pot of steaming rice on a stone stove.

11
00:00:52.283 --> 00:00:56.425
"Is the tea ceremony over already?"

12
00:00:56.986 --> 00:00:57.546
she asked.

13
00:00:59.287 --> 00:01:03.501
Mandy shook her head and asked, "How long does it usually last?"

14
00:01:03.521 --> 00:01:08.163
"Two to four hours," the woman replied.

15
00:01:08.183 --> 00:01:11.044
"Two hours?

16
00:01:11.664 --> 00:01:14.366
I'm glad we got out of there," said Vinnie.

17
00:01:16.506 --> 00:01:18.767
Mandy was looking out a small window.

18
00:01:18.787 --> 00:01:22.529
"A path leads around the kitchen.

19
00:01:24.110 --> 00:01:26.211
It might take us to the front entrance.

20
00:01:27.651 --> 00:01:29.352
We can find the house from there."

21
00:01:32.260 --> 00:01:35.682
The children stepped outside and walked down the path.

22
00:01:37.763 --> 00:01:41.324
But it led them away from the kitchen and into a forest.

23
00:01:43.345 --> 00:01:48.948
"We're really lost now," said Vinnie, realizing how far they had walked.

24
00:01:51.229 --> 00:01:54.050
"My feet hurt," said Mandy.

25
00:01:56.151 --> 00:01:58.312
They had taken their shoes off at the house.

26
00:01:59.752 --> 00:02:02.874
Mandy sat down on a rock and rubbed her bare feet.

27
00:02:04.555 --> 00:02:05.615
"What should we do?"

28
00:02:06.296 --> 00:02:06.936
asked Vinnie.

29
00:02:08.557 --> 00:02:09.798
He sat beside her.

30
00:02:10.338 --> 00:02:12.179
A tree branch cracked nearby.

31
00:02:12.199 --> 00:02:15.461
"Who's there?"

32
00:02:16.001 --> 00:02:16.661
Vinnie said.

33
00:02:18.683 --> 00:02:20.704
A young girl stepped out of the trees.

34
00:02:22.565 --> 00:02:28.108
She was not wearing a kimono but a gray colored top, pants, and straw sandals.

35
00:02:29.916 --> 00:02:32.237
She was holding a basket full of flowers.

36
00:02:32.257 --> 00:02:39.562
"That outfit looks much more comfortable," Mandy said to herself.

37
00:02:41.583 --> 00:02:43.364
She looked at her tight kimono.

38
00:02:43.384 --> 00:02:48.367
"I am Seiko," the girl said shyly.

39
00:02:48.387 --> 00:02:51.608
"Where did you come from?"

40
00:02:51.628 --> 00:02:57.712
"From Daimyo Masamune's house," answered Vinnie.

41
00:02:59.844 --> 00:03:02.387
"Excuse me," Mandy interrupted.

42
00:03:02.407 --> 00:03:05.589
"Where can we get some shoes?"

43
00:03:07.631 --> 00:03:09.233
"Come with me," she said.

44
00:03:12.796 --> 00:03:14.718
She giggled and covered her mouth.

45
00:03:16.339 --> 00:03:20.503
The children followed Seiko and soon they came to a busy street.

46
00:03:23.686 --> 00:03:26.068
Farmers pushed their carts down the road.

47
00:03:27.792 --> 00:03:32.314
Women in colorful kimonos tiptoed by, whispering and giggling.

48
00:03:32.334 --> 00:03:36.216
"Is this your first time in Sendai?"

49
00:03:36.796 --> 00:03:37.596
asked Seiko.

50
00:03:37.616 --> 00:03:41.438
"Yes," replied the children.

51
00:03:43.099 --> 00:03:45.380
They stared at everything around them.

52
00:03:47.421 --> 00:03:49.982
One side of the street had only bookstores.

53
00:03:51.542 --> 00:03:54.884
Shops on the other side sold only things made of straw.

54
00:03:56.532 --> 00:03:57.852
"This is like China!

55
00:03:58.453 --> 00:04:01.453
It's easy to find what you want," said Vinnie.

56
00:04:02.894 --> 00:04:07.055
Seiko took them to a shop selling straw hats, mats, and shoes.

57
00:04:07.075 --> 00:04:14.997
"This is my aunt's shop," said Seiko, handing the children two pairs of straw sandals.

58
00:04:15.017 --> 00:04:18.238
"Do they fit your feet?"

59
00:04:20.198 --> 00:04:24.960
The sandals fit perfectly, but they looked funny with the children's silk
